# Everforest night colours for dunst. Generated by themes/palette/render.py. Do not edit.
# Read as a drop-in: .config/dunst/dunstrc.d/40-theme-black.conf (fallback) and 50-theme.conf (active variant) are
# symlinks to the generated files, so only colours live here and dunstrc keeps the structure.
# Roles: low = quiet (border frame), normal = info (blue frame, green highlight), critical = red,
# recorder = red (recording), idle = yellow (attention), battery = orange (caution).
